    text: "Affected northbound trips:\r\n2:07 pm from Littleton / Mineral Ave Station\r\n\nAffected southbound trips:\r\n2:15 pm from 18th & Stout Station\r\n\nAffected stops:\r\nEnglewood Station\r\nEvans Station\r\nI-25 / Broadway Station\r\nAlameda Station\r\n10th / Osage Station\r\nColfax at Auraria Station\r\nTheatre District / Convention Center\r\n16th Street / California Station\r\n18th St / California Station\r\n18th St / Stout Station\r\n16th Street / Stout Station"
